    <assignments>
        <description>Resets the task record to a blank slate, then sets the core field values (Onboarding, Task, Type, Assignee, Status) for the current iteration. The reset clears any stale field values — particularly Device_Sold__c — left over from a prior iteration where a device task was stamped, preventing those values from bleeding onto subsequent non-device tasks.</description>
