    <description>Compare Scanners sold and Dental Products/Labs to pull across specific training tasks in addition to all generic required training tasks.

9/3/26 AP: Inner device/lab loops no longer exit early on a match — each sets matchFound and runs to exhaustion, so the loop pointer resets between settings. Fixes tasks silently skipped when an earlier setting had already consumed the matching device or lab (OPS-171).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>IT or Trainer</description>
        <name>assignedOwner</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
ISPICKVAL({!Retrieved_Task_Settings_Loop.Assignee__c},&quot;Trainer&quot;),
{!$Record.Assigned_Trainer__c},
{!$Record.Assigned_IT__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Onboarding - After - Generate Onboarding Tasks {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Onboarding - After - Generate Onboarding Tasks</label>
